<Base title="Thank you">
  <p class="eyebrow">Report received</p>
  <h1>Thank you.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Thank you for submitting your report. There is no reference number and no way to look it up — that is the point.</p>
  <p>It will be counted in the next release. Its answers enter the tables only together with a batch of at least five reports, and only inside aggregate statistics published under the rules in the <a href="/docs/release-spec">release specification</a>. <a href="/docs/release-spec#how-we-count">How we count, and how anyone can check</a>.</p>
  <p><a href="/data">See what is published so far</a> · <a href="/contribute">Report another compound</a></p>
</Base>
